684
32:07.510 --> 32:09.090
Gotta go. I'm out.

685
32:19.070 --> 32:19.810
Hello, baby.

686
32:20.070 --> 32:20.460
Tianna,

687
32:20.680 --> 32:22.420
I'm calling you from my watch.

688
32:22.640 --> 32:24.090
Are you being held hostage?

689
32:25.440 --> 32:26.180
Where are you?

690
32:26.590 --> 32:27.570
I'm not being held hostage.

691
32:28.000 --> 32:29.700
I just took first place in my

692
32:29.720 --> 32:30.570
roller skating competition.

693
32:31.200 --> 32:32.490
I video-called Dad,

694
32:32.880 --> 32:33.900
and suddenly

695
32:34.270 --> 32:35.660
I saw Heng

696
32:36.110 --> 32:36.980
flash by in the frame.

697
32:37.310 --> 32:37.940
I was afraid Dad

698
32:38.000 --> 32:39.090
called him over to yell at him again.

699
32:39.400 --> 32:40.220
So I got in the car

700
32:40.510 --> 32:41.980
and rushed to give you a heads-up.

701
32:42.350 --> 32:43.090
Dad's at the equestrian center.

702
32:43.350 --> 32:44.490
Hurry over and check!

703
32:44.920 --> 32:45.770
Heng?

704
32:59.160 --> 33:01.290
Dad, you've gone too far.

705
33:02.030 --> 33:03.140
Zhao Heng is just my boyfriend.

706
33:03.200 --> 33:04.460
He's not your employee.

707
33:04.590 --> 33:05.770
Is there something so huge

708
33:05.830 --> 33:06.220
that you had to

709
33:06.830 --> 33:07.570
call him all the way here

710
33:07.640 --> 33:08.660
to talk to him alone?

711
33:09.400 --> 33:09.940
Well,

712
33:10.400 --> 33:11.330
you should ask him yourself.

713
33:14.030 --> 33:14.490
Tianna.

714
33:15.680 --> 33:16.180
Actually,

715
33:16.880 --> 33:18.490
I came to see Mr. Bu on my own.

716
33:23.000 --> 33:23.530
Why?

717
33:27.920 --> 33:28.380
Here's the thing.

718
33:29.440 --> 33:29.860
I'm on a break

719
33:29.920 --> 33:31.050
after wrapping up the project.

720
33:31.440 --> 33:32.620
So I wanted to use Maxmise's database,

721
33:32.680 --> 33:33.010
my analysis

722
33:33.030 --> 33:34.250
of Siwei Group,

723
33:34.550 --> 33:36.090
and my understanding and observations of you

724
33:36.640 --> 33:37.570
to put together

725
33:37.830 --> 33:38.770
a small business plan

726
33:39.350 --> 33:40.250
and succession analysis

727
33:40.270 --> 33:40.730
for Mr. Bu.

728
33:41.680 --> 33:42.730
Your observations of me?

729
33:45.000 --> 33:45.700
So you're saying

730
33:46.680 --> 33:47.860
you talked to my dad

731
33:48.880 --> 33:50.490
about my future

732
33:50.920 --> 33:52.420
at our own company

733
33:52.510 --> 33:54.460
without my permission.

734
33:54.790 --> 33:55.220
Is that right?

735
33:58.310 --> 33:59.050
You could see it that way.

736
34:00.030 --> 34:00.420
Tianna,

737
34:02.070 --> 34:03.180
you and Mr. Bu definitely know Siwei Group

738
34:03.200 --> 34:04.090
better than I do.

739
34:04.640 --> 34:05.140
But look,

740
34:05.240 --> 34:05.900
ever since you went back to Siwei Group

741
34:05.920 --> 34:06.380
a month ago,

742
34:06.440 --> 34:07.980
you haven't been in a good place.

743
34:08.000 --> 34:09.650
You've even been a little down.

744
34:09.880 --> 34:10.650
So I figured

745
34:11.190 --> 34:11.570
sometimes

746
34:11.630 --> 34:12.900
I can observe and analyze

747
34:12.960 --> 34:13.980
from a third-party perspective,

748
34:14.230 --> 34:15.050
which is better and more objective...

749
34:15.400 --> 34:16.650
Get lost right now.

750
34:18.960 --> 34:19.530
Get out!

751
34:32.190 --> 34:32.610
Mr. Bu,

752
34:33.710 --> 34:34.650
I'll leave the USB drive here for you.

753
34:34.920 --> 34:35.740
You can use it as a reference.

754
34:52.150 --> 34:54.650
Dad, I hope

755
34:55.840 --> 34:57.090
you can show me a little more respect

756
34:57.190 --> 34:58.130
from now on.

757
34:58.440 --> 34:59.900
He's an outsider. You...

758
35:00.000 --> 35:00.980
Have you thought about

759
35:01.070 --> 35:03.780
what an outsider gets

760
35:04.880 --> 35:05.650
out of doing this?

761
35:05.920 --> 35:07.300
He's just trying to butter you up.

762
35:07.320 --> 35:09.530
He already admitted he loves you and loves the benefits.

763
35:09.550 --> 35:11.420
What's wrong with buttering up his future father-in-law?

764
35:14.110 --> 35:15.690
He... he can't just go over my head like that.

765
35:16.920 --> 35:17.650
You think

766
35:18.070 --> 35:19.690
he could keep it a secret that he came

767
35:19.920 --> 35:20.690
to see me privately?

768
35:22.670 --> 35:23.170
Na,

769
35:24.070 --> 35:25.940
you work at the company now.

770
35:26.510 --> 35:28.260
He's an outsider.

771
35:30.670 --> 35:31.610
Since you wanna take over,

772
35:32.800 --> 35:33.420
I suggest you

773
35:33.960 --> 35:35.380
calm down

774
35:35.590 --> 35:36.650
and really think this through.

775
35:36.800 --> 35:37.300
Why would he

776
35:38.150 --> 35:39.940
come to me privately

777
35:40.190 --> 35:41.300
knowing it'd make you angry?

778
35:42.190 --> 35:43.490
And why is he

779
35:43.760 --> 35:44.490
sticking his nose

780
35:44.550 --> 35:45.820
into Siwei Group's internal affairs this early?

781
35:46.190 --> 35:47.300
Isn't he afraid of crossing me?

782
35:48.190 --> 35:49.130
Isn't he worried you'd be mad?

783
35:52.360 --> 35:52.940
Maybe

784
35:54.440 --> 35:55.050
he just

785
35:56.320 --> 35:57.690
genuinely wants to help you with something.

786
36:04.320 --> 36:04.740
Honestly,

787
36:05.320 --> 36:06.050
I still don't like

788
36:07.360 --> 36:08.780
this kid.

789
36:09.590 --> 36:10.420
Too calculating.

790
36:11.030 --> 36:12.010
But even so,

791
36:13.280 --> 36:14.210
I have to admit

792
36:14.800 --> 36:15.650
this proposal of his

793
36:16.400 --> 36:17.460
is pretty good.

794
36:18.960 --> 36:20.690
A lot of thought went into it. Take a look.

795
37:11.360 --> 37:11.610
Zhao Heng,

796
37:11.630 --> 37:12.860
do you know what I hate most?

797
37:14.670 --> 37:16.170
It's when the person I trust most

798
37:16.360 --> 37:17.260
goes behind my back

799
37:17.320 --> 37:18.170
and makes decisions for me.

800
37:18.670 --> 37:19.380
Who do you think you are?

801
37:21.840 --> 37:22.130
Yes.

802
37:23.360 --> 37:24.740
Right now you're my boyfriend.

803
37:25.070 --> 37:25.980
But so what?

804
37:33.760 --> 37:34.260
Tianna,

805
37:35.880 --> 37:37.860
when you left Maxmise,

806
37:37.920 --> 37:39.130
didn't you hand in your resignation letter

807
37:39.150 --> 37:39.940
before you even told me?

808
37:40.510 --> 37:40.860
No...

809
37:41.150 --> 37:42.090
What I mean is,

810
37:42.710 --> 37:43.860
if we weren't together,

811
37:45.110 --> 37:46.170
doing that would've been totally fine.

812
37:47.510 --> 37:48.650
But we are together.

813
37:49.110 --> 37:49.420
I was

814
37:49.440 --> 37:50.530
already your boyfriend then.

815
37:53.000 --> 37:53.650
Is that why

816
37:53.670 --> 37:54.780
you decided to get back at me?

817
37:56.630 --> 37:57.900
You've got some nerve.

818
37:58.280 --> 37:59.380
Have you been binging those

819
37:59.400 --> 38:00.010
kept-husband stories?

820
38:00.400 --> 38:01.010
If I were to break up

821
38:01.030 --> 38:02.090
with you right now, you'd be...

822
38:02.590 --> 38:03.460
you'd be a complete nobody.

823
38:04.070 --> 38:04.740
I'm still me.

824
38:06.670 --> 38:07.980
Even if we break up, I'm still me.

825
38:08.660 --> 38:11.580
♪Hey, long time no see♪

826
38:11.590 --> 38:12.380
Anyway, I came here today

827
38:12.840 --> 38:13.420
prepared to end things

828
38:13.480 --> 38:14.460
with you.

829
38:14.860 --> 38:16.460
♪You don't seem to have changed at all♪

830
38:17.510 --> 38:18.260
You're threatening me?

831
38:18.510 --> 38:19.570
I'm not.

832
38:22.150 --> 38:22.980
I'm trying to survive.

833
38:26.760 --> 38:27.380
I know

834
38:28.030 --> 38:29.050
I'm a schemer.

835
38:30.710 --> 38:31.780
I wanted to climb the ladder

836
38:31.800 --> 38:32.380
through connections.

837
38:33.590 --> 38:34.050
But when we

838
38:34.070 --> 38:35.050
actually got together

839
38:35.840 --> 38:36.940
and even went through a month of fighting

840
38:36.960 --> 38:37.740
and the cold shoulder,

841
38:39.190 --> 38:40.340
I realized I really love you.

842
38:42.020 --> 38:46.500
♪Though I could never tell what was true♪

843
38:46.510 --> 38:47.530
But I really can't take

844
38:47.550 --> 38:48.170
those hurtful words

845
38:48.590 --> 38:49.380
like "you're flattering yourself"

846
38:49.550 --> 38:50.780
and "kept man."

847
38:50.960 --> 38:51.940
I just want equality!

848
38:51.960 --> 38:53.010
Is that so hard?

849
38:55.070 --> 38:55.860
You're dead set

850
38:55.960 --> 38:56.940
on mooching off me.

851
38:57.480 --> 38:58.380
You're in no position to talk equality.

852
38:58.480 --> 38:59.130
Bu Tianna!

853
38:59.920 --> 39:00.690
Your guard's up

854
39:00.710 --> 39:01.570
way too high,

855
39:01.590 --> 39:02.690
and you're way too paranoid!

856
39:03.670 --> 39:04.380
Do you think

857
39:04.400 --> 39:05.260
that as long as I don't obey you,

858
39:05.320 --> 39:06.380
I don't love you?

859
39:07.110 --> 39:08.650
What happened to basic respect

860
39:08.670 --> 39:09.610
between people?

861
39:10.360 --> 39:11.010
If I were really

862
39:11.030 --> 39:12.380
just using you to get ahead,

863
39:12.440 --> 39:12.820
then I'd...

864
39:13.150 --> 39:14.170
I'd just lie through my teeth

865
39:14.190 --> 39:15.780
and keep you happy!

866
39:16.670 --> 39:17.420
But that kind of love

867
39:17.440 --> 39:19.090
won't last.

868
39:19.670 --> 39:21.130
It's exactly because I really love you

869
39:21.190 --> 39:22.860
that I did this, even knowing

870
39:22.920 --> 39:24.090
you might break up with me.

871
39:24.360 --> 39:25.740
I don't wanna wait five years, ten years,

872
39:25.920 --> 39:26.420
until maybe

873
39:26.440 --> 39:27.340
I don't even like

874
39:27.440 --> 39:28.130
or love you anymore,

875
39:28.230 --> 39:28.940
and then end up

876
39:29.110 --> 39:30.380
sad and heartbroken!

877
39:35.680 --> 39:39.440
♪Hey, long time no see♪

878
39:39.440 --> 39:40.570
I'm gambling, you know?

879
39:43.030 --> 39:43.820
That USB drive

880
39:44.320 --> 39:45.490
is my parting gift to you.

881
39:47.150 --> 39:47.780
I really put

882
39:47.880 --> 39:49.690
serious thought, real effort,

883
39:49.760 --> 39:50.420
and a professional eye

884
39:50.550 --> 39:51.420
into helping you plan

885
39:51.440 --> 39:52.300
your career

886
39:52.440 --> 39:54.300
and Siwei's overall future.

887
39:54.950 --> 39:58.630
♪I'm still wearing it close to my heart♪

888
39:58.630 --> 39:59.380
But I lost the bet.

889
40:02.300 --> 40:08.200
♪I miss all the things you used to say♪

890
40:10.280 --> 40:10.610
Also,

891
40:11.880 --> 40:13.050
in the year I've been with you,

892
40:13.840 --> 40:14.940
have I ever spent a single cent of your money?

893
40:15.230 --> 40:17.030
♪Maybe a joke♪

894
40:17.030 --> 40:18.050
Have I ever done a single thing

895
40:18.190 --> 40:19.170
to wrong you?

896
40:19.170 --> 40:20.950
♪Somehow ended up being taken seriously♪

897
40:20.950 --> 40:23.950
♪One street, then another♪

898
40:24.380 --> 40:28.430
♪I didn't know what to do♪

899
40:28.880 --> 40:32.250
♪Suddenly, the whole world fell silent♪

900
40:32.600 --> 40:35.380
♪And I was left feeling uneasy♪

901
40:35.830 --> 40:41.500
♪Only the sound of rain was left to touch me♪

902
40:42.630 --> 40:45.600
♪Even sorrow grew quiet♪

903
40:45.880 --> 40:50.700
♪Leaving only a role that smiles while it cries♪

904
40:50.700 --> 40:54.680
♪May your blessings be worth it♪

905
40:56.960 --> 40:58.170
What am I supposed to do?

906
41:00.880 --> 41:02.300
Is Zhao Heng genuinely heartbroken

907
41:02.360 --> 41:03.530
and wants to break up, or

908
41:04.110 --> 41:05.460
is he just backing off

909
41:06.280 --> 41:07.570
to force me to cave later?

910
41:09.480 --> 41:10.490
Your whole situation is a little

911
41:10.510 --> 41:11.530
too complicated.

912
41:12.670 --> 41:14.740
With the little relationship experience I've got,

913
41:15.590 --> 41:16.380
I'm not sure

914
41:16.400 --> 41:16.940
what to do either.

915
41:22.710 --> 41:23.650
Sorry, I...

916
41:24.400 --> 41:24.900
I knew

917
41:24.960 --> 41:25.980
you just started a new project,

918
41:26.030 --> 41:26.820
and I still called you out.

919
41:28.150 --> 41:28.900
What are you saying?

920
41:29.710 --> 41:31.260
Nothing matters more than you.

921
41:33.770 --> 41:35.280
[Lin, Maxmise]

922
41:40.440 --> 41:40.940
Lin.

923
41:42.320 --> 41:42.940
I don't know

924
41:43.000 --> 41:44.090
if you and Tianna know about this, but...

925
41:45.480 --> 41:46.050
Hang on.

926
41:48.670 --> 41:49.090
Go ahead.

927
41:50.480 --> 41:51.570
I just heard from Lu Le

928
41:51.670 --> 41:52.340
that Zhao Heng joined

929
41:52.400 --> 41:53.460
her Haiji Petroleum project.

930
41:53.550 --> 41:54.980
He's heading to

931
41:55.030 --> 41:55.860
the Venezuela project site today.

932
41:56.110 --> 41:56.690
And with this project,

933
41:56.800 --> 41:58.130
he'll be in South America

934
41:58.150 --> 41:58.860
for at least two months.

935
42:00.110 --> 42:00.740
South America?

936
42:02.480 --> 42:02.980
Lin,

937
42:03.070 --> 42:04.210
can you check

938
42:04.230 --> 42:04.610
the OA system

939
42:04.630 --> 42:04.980
and see

940
42:05.000 --> 42:06.340
when Zhao Heng booked his ticket?

941
42:07.280 --> 42:08.090
Sure, hang on.

942
42:11.510 --> 42:13.210
He booked it three days ago.

943
42:13.880 --> 42:14.690
But two hours ago,

944
42:14.800 --> 42:15.460
he changed it

945
42:15.510 --> 42:16.820
to tonight's 8 PM flight.

946
42:21.800 --> 42:22.420
Eight.

947
42:22.880 --> 42:23.780
Got it. Thanks, Lin.

948
42:23.800 --> 42:24.300
I'm hanging up.

949
42:31.030 --> 42:32.490
So he really was gambling.

950
42:33.320 --> 42:34.980
He had already made his decision.

951
42:35.320 --> 42:37.170
He just finally gave up just now.

952
42:38.400 --> 42:39.780
Venezuela.

953
42:40.480 --> 42:42.780
Halfway across the world. Two months.

954
42:44.480 --> 42:45.490
Isn't that a perfect

955
42:45.590 --> 42:46.900
breakup cooling-off period?

956
42:47.840 --> 42:48.690
I don't think

957
42:48.760 --> 42:49.650
that's what he meant.

958
42:50.480 --> 42:51.300
He...

959
42:52.510 --> 42:54.260
It's fine.

960
42:55.000 --> 42:55.940
It's just a breakup.

961
42:56.030 --> 42:57.050
Who hasn't been through one?

962
42:57.630 --> 42:58.900
He chose to break up with me

963
42:58.960 --> 42:59.780
this way.

964
43:00.190 --> 43:01.690
If I drag it out,

965
43:02.030 --> 43:02.980
I'd be so pathetic.

966
43:10.630 --> 43:11.490
It's fine, really.

967
43:46.780 --> 43:51.660
♪Orange sky at dusk; the evening breeze is waiting♪

968
43:51.940 --> 43:56.820
♪The crowd at the crossing suddenly scatters♪

969
43:57.060 --> 44:05.380
♪This world moves too fast, yet you walk slowly toward me♪

970
44:07.700 --> 44:12.620
♪We're like the evening breeze tangling with the clouds♪

971
44:12.780 --> 44:17.700
♪Strolling among the clouds, waiting for the sky to clear♪

972
44:17.740 --> 44:22.300
♪Last time you had something left unsaid, right?♪

973
44:22.540 --> 44:27.420
♪Why did you stop again?♪

974
44:28.020 --> 44:32.660
♪We keep moving like the stream, never resting♪

975
44:33.380 --> 44:37.740
♪Through the muddy fields, rushing toward the sea♪

976
44:37.780 --> 44:42.780
♪I know you'll be waiting there♪

977
44:43.100 --> 44:47.980
♪Together with me♪

978
44:48.740 --> 44:53.620
♪We're like the evening breeze tangling with the clouds♪

979
44:54.140 --> 44:58.700
♪Strolling among the clouds, waiting for the sky to clear♪

980
44:58.740 --> 45:03.300
♪You steal glances at me. You like me, right?♪

981
45:03.580 --> 45:08.460
♪Stop running away♪

982
45:29.580 --> 45:34.740
♪The sky slowly brightens, falling into our eyes♪

983
45:34.900 --> 45:39.740
♪The wind gradually stops, and finally it clears up♪

984
45:40.020 --> 45:45.060
♪The evening breeze brushes past your shoulder, and you turn your head♪

985
45:45.940 --> 45:51.060
♪You're irreplaceable♪

986
45:51.060 --> 45:52.060
kissasia.biz
